      <purpose>To record an individual's natural preference for using a specific hand for various motor tasks.</purpose>
      <keywords>handedness, right handed, left handed, laterality</keywords>
      <use>Use to record an individual's natural preference for using a specific hand for various motor tasks.</use>
      <misuse>Not to be used to record other aspects of human laterality, such as dominant foot, eye or ear. A separate archetype is intended for this use case but was not available at the time of authoring or publication.</misuse>
